      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, a 200mg dose? that seems like a lot. and you said it \"boosts dopamine\"? i thought haloperidol is supposed to block dopamine to help with my schizophrenia... wouldn't adding a stimulant like sudafed mess with that or my heart rate?",
